msgstr "Licence"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tipkovnica"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tipkovnica<br><em>dostojna cara.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Brza kao Anax – vilin konjic veliki car.<br>Precizna kao njegov lov."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nadahnuta Swypeom. Rođena kao Swajp.</strong> Tipkovnica za Android na kojoj pišeš klizanjem prsta. Riječi pogađa iz konteksta, uči tvoj stil, a svi tvoji podaci ostaju u telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Nabavite na Google Playu"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Jezični paketi"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Mogućnosti"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Pisanje potezima"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Prijeđi prstom preko slova i riječ se pojavi."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Predviđanje riječi"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Nudi sljedeću riječ prema onome što pišeš."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Geste i uređivanje teksta"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Kopiraj, zalijepi, poništi i označi jednim potezom."

#: index
msgid "Themes &amp; colours"
msgstr "Teme i boje"

#: index
msgid "Six themes or colours of your own."
msgstr "Šest tema ili vlastite boje."

#: index
msgid "Size &amp; layout"
msgstr "Veličina i raspored"

#: index
msgid "Split, one-handed or floating."
msgstr "Podijeljena, za jednu ruku ili plutajuća."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Brojčanik i kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Velike znamenke, kalkulator i znanstveni kalkulator."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emotikoni"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Napiši riječ i emotikon doleti."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dva jezika odjednom, ukupno 35."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Izvanmrežno diktiranje"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Govor u tekst izravno u telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Povijest međuspremnika"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "Zadnjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvijek pri ruci."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Sigurnosna kopija"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Prenesi naučene riječi na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Bez interneta, bez oglasa, bez praćenja."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prethodno"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Sljedeće"

#: index
msgid "Another word from the bar"
msgstr "Druga riječ iz trake"

#: index
msgid "Capital letter"
msgstr "Veliko slovo"

#: index
msgid "Character from the key corner"
msgstr "Znak iz kuta tipke"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Kliži po tipkama poput vilinog konjica."

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate. Words with a similar swipe wait in the suggestion bar – one tap swaps them. For a capital letter, slide from the first letter up above the keyboard and straight on to the next one. A swipe from a letter to the space bar types the character from its corner, such as ? or !"
msgstr ""
"Ne moraš tipkati slovo po slovo – dovoljan je jedan potez preko slova riječi. Swajp prepoznaje potez i kad nije savršen te uči tvoj stil, pa je sve precizniji. Riječi sa sličnim potezom čekaju na traci prijedloga – jednim dodirom ih zamijeniš. Za veliko slovo s prvog slova kreni gore iznad tipkovnice i odande ravno na sljedeće. Potez sa slova na razmaknicu upisuje znak iz njegova kuta, npr. ? ili !"

#: index
msgid "Next word suggestion"
msgstr "Prijedlog sljedeće riječi"

#: index
msgid "Fixing a typo"
msgstr "Ispravak tipfelera"

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr ""
"Predviđa tvoju sljedeću riječ kao što vilin konjic predviđa let svog plijena."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next – after a space, just tap it. It uses context to tell similar words apart and learns the words you actually use. When you tap out a word with a typo, the bar shows what you typed next to the fix, and the space bar inserts the highlighted fix."
msgstr ""
"Prema prethodnim riječima nudi ono što ćeš vjerojatno sljedeće napisati – nakon razmaka samo dodirni. Iz konteksta razlikuje slične riječi i uči riječi koje stvarno koristiš. Kad pri tipkanju pogriješiš, traka pokazuje napisano pored ispravka, a razmaknica umeće istaknuti ispravak."

#: index
msgid "Copy and paste"
msgstr "Kopiraj i zalijepi"

#: index
msgid "Undo and redo"
msgstr "Poništi i ponovi"

#: index
msgid "Select all and deselect"
msgstr "Označi sve i ukloni oznaku"

#: index
msgid "UPPER / lower case"
msgstr "VELIKA / mala slova"

#: index
msgid "Deleting words and lines"
msgstr "Brisanje riječi i redaka"

#: index
msgid "Moving the cursor"
msgstr "Pomak kursora"

#: index
msgid "Text editing – the [I] key"
msgstr "Uređivanje teksta – tipka [I]"

#: index
msgid "Selecting several lines"
msgstr "Označavanje više redaka"

#: index
msgid "Start and end"
msgstr "Početak i kraj"

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Vlada zrakom. Sad vlada i tvojim tekstom."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – Enter → space undoes, Swajp → space redoes, up to 60 steps. Copy, paste, cut or select all with a swipe from the Swajp key to C, V, X or A, and change case with a single gesture. Slide left from ⌫ to delete whole words, or up for whole lines. Double-tap the space bar and slide to move the cursor as precisely as landing on a reed. The [I] key opens editing with arrows, selection, Start and End."
msgstr ""
"Leti i unatrag i naprijed – Enter → razmaknica poništava, Swajp → razmaknica vraća, do 60 koraka. Kopiraj, zalijepi, izreži ili označi sve potezom s tipke Swajp na C, V, X ili A, a veličinu slova mijenjaš jednom gestom. Potezom s ⌫ ulijevo brišeš cijele riječi, prema gore cijele retke. Dvaput dodirni razmaknicu i povuci – pokazivač pomičeš precizno kao vilin konjic kad slijeće na trsku. Tipka [I] otvara uređivanje sa strelicama, označavanjem, Početkom i Krajem."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Sve geste s prikazima i isprobavanjem nalaze se u aplikaciji: Postavke → Geste i vodič."

#: index
msgid "Light green"
msgstr "Svijetlozelena"

#: index
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svijetla"

#: index
msgid "AMOLED black"
msgstr "AMOLED crna"

#: index
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Plava"

#: index
msgid "Orange"
msgstr "Narančasta"

#: index
msgid "Purple"
msgstr "Ljubičasta"

#: index
msgid "Admire its many shimmering colours."
msgstr "Divi se njezinim brojnim svjetlucavim bojama."

#: index
msgid ""
"Pick a ready-made theme or set your own colours for the highlight, keys, special keys, background and text. You can also adjust the font size in the suggestion bar, vibration and key sounds."
msgstr ""
"Odaberi gotovu temu ili postavi vlastite boje za isticanje, tipke, posebne tipke, pozadinu i tekst. Možeš prilagoditi i veličinu slova na traci prijedloga, vibraciju i zvukove tipki."

#: index
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Cijela"

#: index
msgid "Taller"
msgstr "Viša"

#: index
msgid "Smaller and lifted"
msgstr "Manja i podignuta"

#: index
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

#: index
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Plutajuća"

#: index
msgid "Spread your wings, or fold them out of the way."
msgstr "Raširi krila ili ih sklopi da ne smetaju."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick Size: drag the handles to change the height, width and position. Make it taller, or smaller and lifted off the bottom edge, split it into two halves for both thumbs (Tablet), move it to the edge for one hand, or let it float freely above apps. In landscape the keyboard is lower and split."
msgstr ""
"Drži tipku Swajp i odaberi Veličinu: povlačenjem ručki mijenjaš visinu, širinu i položaj. Učini je višom ili manjom i podignutom od donjeg ruba, podijeli je na dvije polovice za oba palca (Tablet), pomakni je uz rub za jednu ruku ili je pusti da slobodno pluta iznad aplikacija. U vodoravnom položaju tipkovnica je niža i podijeljena."

#: index
msgid "Number pad"
msgstr "Brojčanik"

#: index
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Percent and brackets"
msgstr "Postotak i zagrade"

#: index
msgid "Scientific calculator"
msgstr "Znanstveni kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "I bistroj glavi dobro dođe kalkulator."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the [I] key for the number pad: big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. The calculator counts right in the suggestion bar and inserts the result into the text. It handles percent (200 + 10 % = 220) and brackets, and the scientific mode adds functions, powers, degrees and radians – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Drži tipku [I] za brojčanik: velike znamenke za brz unos telefonskih brojeva i iznosa. Kalkulator računa izravno na traci prijedloga i umeće rezultat u tekst. Zna postotke (200 + 10 % = 220) i zagrade, a znanstveni način dodaje funkcije, potencije, stupnjeve i radijane – bez prebacivanja aplikacija."

#: index
msgid "Emoji from a word"
msgstr "Emotikon iz riječi"

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Uhvati emociju u letu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"Napiši riječ potezom ili tipkanjem – npr. „srce“, „pivo“ ili „tužan“ – i Swajp ti u traci prijedloga ponudi emotikon. Radi i prečac :), a možeš ga i jednostavno odabrati s popisa."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once"
msgstr "Dva jezika odjednom"

#: index
msgid "A new word for the dictionary"
msgstr "Nova riječ u rječniku"

#: index
msgid "Hindi"
msgstr "Hindski"

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Rođena da vlada – na 35 jezika."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. Tap an unknown word in the bar to add it to the dictionary of one language or both. In Hindi you type in Latin letters (Hinglish) and get Devanagari – or stay with Latin. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Piši na dva jezika bez prebacivanja – tipkovnica zna riječi iz oba. Dodirom nepoznate riječi na traci dodaješ je u rječnik jednog ili oba jezika. Na hindskom pišeš latinicom (Hinglish) i dobivaš devanagari – ili ostaješ na latinici. 9 jezika je ugrađeno (engleski u dvije varijante), još 26 možeš preuzeti kao pakete."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Zeleno</span> označeni jezici ugrađeni su u aplikaciju, ostale možeš <a href=\"languages.html\">preuzeti kao pakete</a>."

#: index
msgid "Dictation"
msgstr "Diktiranje"

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Čuje te. Nikome ne govori."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick the microphone – the text appears as you speak. Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Drži tipku Swajp i odaberi mikrofon – tekst se piše dok govoriš. Govor se pretvara u tekst izravno u telefonu (modeli Parakeet i Omnilingual), bez interneta. Ako želiš, umjesto toga možeš koristiti prepoznavanje govora Google. Prepoznate riječi provjeravaju se prema rječniku."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Pamti što kopiraš. Tajne zaboravlja."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold Enter and pick the clipboard: your last 30 copied texts are always at hand – tap to paste, pin the ones you want to keep. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"Drži Enter i odaberi međuspremnik: zadnjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvijek ti je pri ruci – dodirom ih zalijepiš, a one koje želiš zadržati prikvačiš. Lozinke, kodovi i tekst označen kao osjetljiv nikad se ne spremaju, a povijest se sama briše nakon vremena koje odabereš."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Vilin konjic može preletjeti more. Tvoje naučene riječi i stil pisanja mogu preletjeti na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Postavke, tvoje riječi i sve što je Swajp naučio iz tvog pisanja spremaju se u jednu datoteku – učitaj je na novom telefonu i Swajp odmah piše kao tvoj. Datoteka ostaje kod tebe: ništa ne ide preko interneta ni u oblak."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Ti si lovac, nikad plijen."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nikakvo praćenje, najveća privatnost. </strong>Swajp nema dopuštenje za pristup internetu. Ništa što napišeš ili izvanmrežno izdiktiraš ne može napustiti tvoj telefon. Bez oglasa, bez analitike. U poljima za lozinke ništa se ne uči niti sprema."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Pravila privatnosti →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Kažu da kad na tebe sleti vilin konjic, u tvoj život dolazi promjena.</span>Neka ovaj sleti na vrhove tvojih prstiju."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – jezični paketi"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Jezici koji nisu ugrađeni u aplikaciju mogu se dodati kao paket. To je obična zip datoteka s rječnikom – ništa se ne instalira i aplikaciji za to ne treba internet."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Kako dodati paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Preuzmi zip željenog jezika. Spremit će se u mapu Preuzimanja."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Otvori <b>Swajp → Postavke → Jezici → Dodatni jezici (paketi)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Dodirni <b>Uvezi jezične pakete (jedan ili više)</b> i odaberi preuzetu datoteku."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Odaberi novi jezik kao glavni ili drugi jezik."

